sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant WorkerA
  participant WorkerB
  participant Coordinator
  participant Redis
  participant ActorDB as MongoDB
  WorkerA->>Coordinator: Acquire lease for worker A
  Coordinator->>Redis: SET lease NX PX with token
  Redis-->>Coordinator: Acquired
  Coordinator->>Redis: Increment generation and update status hash
  WorkerB->>Coordinator: Acquire lease for worker B
  Coordinator->>Redis: SET lease NX PX
  Redis-->>Coordinator: Lease busy
  loop While lease holder is healthy
    WorkerA->>Coordinator: Renew with worker ID and token
    Coordinator->>Redis: Compare token and extend TTL
  end
  Note over WorkerA,Redis: If A stops renewing, the lease key expires
  WorkerB->>Coordinator: Retry acquisition
  Coordinator->>Redis: SET lease NX PX with new token
  Redis-->>Coordinator: Acquired
  Coordinator->>Redis: Increment generation
  WorkerB->>ActorDB: Process only with current singleton generation
